<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/31/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Notwithstanding the provisions of the Fees act 1951 [Act 209], the fees which were charged and collected by the Malaysian Meteorological Department in respect of any meteorological service and publication during the period from 1 January 1973 to 31 December 2009 shall be deemed to have been validly charged and collected."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/31/eng@> .
